        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a2429d84-2b78-42c4-a88d-82b8984ca92d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your destination is a small restaurant in a bustling Chinese city, where a secret smuggling operation is occuring.\r Four people have been selected as targets; Gao Ling, the operation leader, Angus Pritchard, the current client of the smugglers, Qiang Wang, financial handler, and Buck McKeever, scout and lookout on the roof.\rThis mission should not be taken lightly. If you are spotted, the smugglers will escape, and the mission will fail.\rGood luck, 47.",
